PART 2 — EDUCATIONAL CONTENT (Non-Commercial)
第二部分 — 教学内容（非商业授权）

Applies to the educational material: question text, answer explanations,
level design, and accompanying prose — specifically the content inside
`src/lib/quiz/*-questions.ts` and any narrative copy in the pages.

The content is free to read, use for personal learning, and share
non-commercially, provided the source and author are credited.

Any commercial use — including but not limited to publication, paid training,
paid course adaptation, or inclusion in a commercial product — requires prior
written permission from the author.

适用于教学内容：题目文本、答案解释、关卡设计及页面叙述文字，
具体包括 `src/lib/quiz/*-questions.ts` 中的内容与页面文案。

内容供读者免费阅读、个人学习与非商业性分享，转载请注明出处与作者；
任何商业用途（包括但不限于出版、培训、付费内容改编、并入商业产品）
须事先获得作者书面许可。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Rationale / 双协议的理由

Code under MIT so that others can freely study, fork, reuse the judging engine
and spaced-repetition scheduler, and contribute back — many organizations
prohibit depending on non-OSI-approved licenses.

Content under a non-commercial license because that is where the actual
authorial investment lies.

代码用 MIT，是为了让判定引擎、间隔重复调度这些通用部分能被自由学习、
复用和贡献回来 —— 很多组织的合规政策禁止依赖非 OSI 认证的协议。

内容用非商业协议，因为那才是真正投入了作者心力的部分。
